1
00:00:00,324 --> 00:00:02,024
(Bernadette:)Come on.

2
00:00:05,762 --> 00:00:07,532
(Bernadette:)What about that sweater?

3
00:00:07,531 --> 00:00:09,331
(Sheldon:)No, it's not good enough.

4
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:11,533
(Sheldon:)It has to be perfect.

5
00:00:11,535 --> 00:00:13,505
(Bernadette:)I think the nicest gifts
I've got from Howie

6
00:00:13,503 --> 00:00:15,303
(Bernadette:)show how well
he knows me.

7
00:00:15,305 --> 00:00:16,405
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

8
00:00:16,406 --> 00:00:19,006
(Sheldon:)Let's see,
what do I know about Amy?

9
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:22,979
She loves medieval literature;
Chaucer's her favorite.

10
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,620
(Sheldon:)And her eyes sparkle when
she watches old French movies.

11
00:00:31,154 --> 00:00:32,254
(Sheldon:)I enjoy how harp music causes
her fingers to dance

12
00:00:32,255 --> 00:00:33,355
(Sheldon:)as if she's playing along.

13
00:00:33,357 --> 00:00:36,157
(Bernadette:)Wow, you really do love her.

14
00:00:37,361 --> 00:00:38,661
(Amy:)I do.

15
00:00:39,863 --> 00:00:41,863
(Sheldon:)Now, let's find
the kind of gift

16
00:00:41,865 --> 00:01:14,035
(Sheldon:)that makes her feel
small and worthless.

